[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5921089237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123888#issuecomment-5921089237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123888","id":5921089237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYOym1Q","user":{"login":"Kermalis","id":29823718,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5ODIzNzE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29823718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis","html_url":"https://github.com/Kermalis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kermalis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-30T22:51:44Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T22:51:44Z","body":"I know this PR isn't the perfect place to mention this, but #96329 didn't touch `string` methods such as `Label.Text`, and it'd be really great if it did because there are so many allocations when setting text already. In my case, I'm using a source string and using Substring() repeatedly on it for a certain project. It'd be great to instead only have the 1 source string and slice it into spans to set the `label.Text`.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5921089237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5936772550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123888#issuecomment-5936772550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123888","id":5936772550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYdv1xg","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T17:24:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T19:32:04Z","body":"> I know this PR isn't the perfect place to mention this, but https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/96329 didn't touch string methods such as Label.Text, and it'd be really great if it did because there are so many allocations when setting text already. In my case, I'm using a source string and using Substring() repeatedly on it for a certain project. It'd be great to instead only have the 1 source string and slice it into spans to set the label.Text.\r\n\r\nJoin the [Developer Chat Channel](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/dotnet), and let's discuss your ideal version of the API. I suspect your proposal can't be achieved in a backward-compatible way, but less alloc is always preferred.\r\n\r\nOr https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106676 might be a good place to discuss this.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5936772550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]